#: includes/admin-dashboard.js:4048
msgid "Console Error Handler"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-dashboard.js:4048
msgid ""
"What it does: reads pasted browser console errors and looks for missing globals, missing jQuery plugin methods, stack-trace URLs, and dependency clues.\n"
"\n"
"Why it helps: it can propose the script that should move earlier instead of blindly excluding the script that shouted first.\n"
"\n"
"Watch for: it only proposes visible fixes. It does not create hidden exceptions."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-dashboard.js:4052
msgid "Console errors to analyze"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-dashboard.js:4052
msgid ""
"What it does: gives the handler the raw error text to study.\n"
"\n"
"Why it helps: error lines, stack traces, and script URLs help UltraCache tell the difference between the script that failed and the missing script that caused the failure.\n"
"\n"
"Watch for: after applying one fix, test again. One missing dependency can hide the next error."
msgstr ""

